            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <h3>New</h3>
                <ul>
                <li>Select and copy the text of a result card (#17)</li>
                <li>Show documents' fields A to Z from the View menu (#12)</li>
                <li>Disconnect every open connection at once (#10)</li>
                <li>Import documents into a collection from JSON or CSV (#9)</li>
                <li>Import and export saved connections as Compass files (#8)</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Fixes</h3>
                <ul>
                <li>Ask before closing a tab stops an import (#19)</li>
                <li>Retry the releases repo check, and say why it failed (#15)</li>
                <li>Show long index names and compound keys whole (#14)</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
